---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import RelayPingCard from '../components/RelayPingCard.astro';
import BlossomPingCard from '../components/BlossomPingCard.astro';
import ServerSupportCard from '../components/ServerSupportCard.astro';
import CopyButton from '../components/CopyButton.astro';
import { communityRelay, cacheRelay, recommendedRelays } from '../data/relays';
import { communityBlossomServer, recommendedBlossomServers } from '../data/blossom';
import { Radio, HardDrive, HelpCircle, CheckCircle2, ArrowRight, Zap, Terminal } from 'lucide-astro';
import BreadcrumbSchema from '../components/seo/BreadcrumbSchema.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Ana Sayfa', path: '/' },
  { name: 'Röleler & Medya Sunucuları', path: '/roleler' },
];
---

<Layout 
  title="Röleler & Blossom Medya Sunucuları - Nostr Türkiye Topluluğu"
  description="Nostr Türkiye resmi rölesi (relay.nostr.org.tr), pull-through cache rölesi (cache.nostr.org.tr), Blossom medya sunucusu (media.nostr.org.tr), küresel açık mirrorlar ve istemci kurulum rehberi."
>
  <BreadcrumbSchema slot="head" items={breadcrumbs} />
  
  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-20 border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-slate-50 to-slate-100/50 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-950">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-nostr-100 dark:bg-nostr-950 text-nostr-700 dark:text-nostr-300 border border-nostr-200 dark:border-nostr-800 mb-6 shadow-sm">
        <Radio class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-nostr-500" />
        <span>Merkeziyetsiz Altyapı & Medya Ağı</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-[1.2]">
        Türkiye & Küresel Altyapı
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Nostr'da metin mesajları bağımsız rölelerde, medya dosyaları ise Blossom blob sunucularında taşınır. Altyapı adreslerini inceleyin ve istemcinize ekleyin.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Infrastructure Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Official Community Infrastructure Spotlight -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>Resmi Topluluk Altyapısı</span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-tr-red"></span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
              Türkiye topluluğu için barındırılan resmi iletişim rölesi, pull-through cache rölesi ve Blossom medya sunucusu.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <RelayPingCard relay={communityRelay} />
          <RelayPingCard relay={cacheRelay} />
          <BlossomPingCard server={communityBlossomServer} />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: Recommended Relays -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
              <Radio class="w-6 h-6 text-nostr-500" />
              <span>Tavsiye Edilen Küresel Röleler</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
              Ağ dayanıklılığını artırmak için istemcinize birden fazla açık röle ekleyebilirsiniz.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {recommendedRelays.filter(r => !r.isOfficialCommunityRelay).map((relay) => (
            <RelayPingCard relay={relay} />
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Recommended Blossom & Mirror Servers -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
              <HardDrive class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400" />
              <span>Açık Blossom Medya & Mirror Sunucuları</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
              Medya içeriklerinizin kaybolmaması için tek bir sunucu yerine ayna (mirror) sunucuları da yapılandırmanız önerilir.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/rehber#blossom-medya-sunuculari"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 hover:underline"
          >
            <span>Blossom & Mirror Kılavuzunu Oku</span>
            <ArrowRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {recommendedBlossomServers.filter(s => !s.isOfficialCommunityServer).map((server) => (
            <BlossomPingCard server={server} showMirrorList={false} />
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Server Costs & Support Card -->
      <div>
        <ServerSupportCard />
      </div>

      <!-- How to add relays & blossom servers guide -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-nostr-100 dark:bg-nostr-950 text-nostr-600 dark:text-nostr-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <HelpCircle class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              İstemcinize Röle ve Medya Sunucusu Nasıl Eklenir?
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
              İstemcilerinizde hem metin rölelerini hem de Blossom medya sunucularını tanımlayarak tam merkeziyetsizlik sağlayın.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Relay Configuration Cards -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">
            1. Röle Ekleme (relay.nostr.org.tr)
          </h4>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-nostr-200/90 dark:border-nostr-800/70">
              <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-nostr-500" />
                <span>Nostrich (Türkçe Destekli)</span>
              </h5>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Ayarlar > Röleler sekmesinden <code class="font-mono text-nostr-600 dark:text-nostr-400">wss://relay.nostr.org.tr</code> adresini kaydedin. Web, iOS, Android ve Mac'te yerel Türkçe arayüzü destekler.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700/60">
              <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-nostr-500" />
                <span>Damus (iOS / macOS)</span>
              </h5>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Ayarlar > Röleler (Relays) bölümüne gidin. <code class="font-mono text-nostr-600 dark:text-nostr-400">wss://relay.nostr.org.tr</code> adresini yapıştırıp Ekle'ye dokunun.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700/60">
              <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-nostr-500" />
                <span>Amethyst (Android)</span>
              </h5>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Sol menüden Ayarlar > Röleler sekmesini açın. "+" butonuna basarak röle URL'sini ekleyin.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700/60">
              <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-nostr-500" />
                <span>Primal (Web / Mobil)</span>
              </h5>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Settings > Network / Relays bölümüne gidin ve özel röle listesine ekleyin.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Blossom Configuration Cards -->
        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <HardDrive class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            <span>2. Blossom Medya Sunucusu Ekleme (media.nostr.org.tr)</span>
          </h4>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-purple-200/80 dark:border-purple-900/50">
              <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-500" />
                <span>Amethyst (Android)</span>
              </h5>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Ayarlar > Medya Yüklemeleri (Media Uploads) > Medya Sunucuları bölümüne <code class="font-mono text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">https://media.nostr.org.tr</code> adresini ve yedek mirrorları ekleyin.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-purple-200/80 dark:border-purple-900/50">
              <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-500" />
                <span>Coracle & Web İstemcileri</span>
              </h5>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Settings > Media Servers / Blossom bölümünden <code class="font-mono text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">https://media.nostr.org.tr</code> sunucusunu birincil veya ayna olarak kaydedin.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-purple-200/80 dark:border-purple-900/50">
              <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-500" />
                <span>Nostrudel & Diğerleri</span>
              </h5>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Medya Tercihleri altında Blossom Media Server (BUD-01/02) seçeneğini işaretleyip sunucu URL'nizi girin.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pull-Through Cache Relay Configuration & Usage -->
        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Zap class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            <span>3. Pull-Through Cache Rölesi Kullanımı (cache.nostr.org.tr)</span>
          </h4>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-blue-200/80 dark:border-blue-900/50 space-y-4">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
                <Terminal class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-500" />
                <span>Upstream Rölelerle Dinamik Önbellekleme</span>
              </h5>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                <code class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">cache.nostr.org.tr</code> salt-okunur (read-only) bir pull-through cache rölesidir. İstemcinizden veya CLI araçlarınızdan sorgulamak istediğiniz upstream röleleri URL parametresi olarak iletebilirsiniz. Röle, upstream röleleri paralel sorgulayarak sonuçları edge üzerinde önbelleğe alır ve hızlıca iletir.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">nak CLI Örneği:</span>
                <CopyButton text='nak req -k 1 -l 10 "wss://cache.nostr.org.tr?relays=wss://relay.damus.io,wss://nos.lol"' label="nak Komutunu Kopyala" />
              </div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 font-mono text-xs overflow-x-auto select-all">
                <code>nak req -k 1 -l 10 "wss://cache.nostr.org.tr?relays=wss://relay.damus.io,wss://nos.lol"</code>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs pt-1">
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800">
                <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white block mb-0.5">Tekil Röle Örneği:</span>
                <code class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-mono break-all text-[11px]">wss://cache.nostr.org.tr?relays=wss://relay.damus.io</code>
              </div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800">
                <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white block mb-0.5">Çoklu Röle Örneği (Virgülle Ayrılmış):</span>
                <code class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-mono break-all text-[11px]">wss://cache.nostr.org.tr?relays=wss://relay.damus.io,wss://nos.lol</code>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
